# Syntheniq AI Video Editor - Environment Configuration
# 
# This is a documentation file. Copy the relevant .env.example files
# from the subdirectories and customize them for your environment:
#
# API Server: cp apps/api/.env.example apps/api/.env.local
# Web Frontend: cp apps/web/.env.example apps/web/.env.local
#
# Then edit the .env.local files with your specific settings.
#
# See README.md for quick start instructions and deployment guides.

# API Server Configuration (see apps/api/.env.example for full list)
# PORT=8788
# MAX_UPLOAD_MB=2048
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_EDITORIAL_KEY=
# DATABASE_URL=
# STORAGE_DRIVER=local

# Web Frontend Configuration (see apps/web/.env.example)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8788